HELLO_STR|My name is {}, say hello!|blob|
HELLO_MESSAGE_STR|Hello, {}!|blob
WAKE_STR|say hello|blob
GREET_STR|Hey there, I haven't seen you in {}!|blob
MORNING_STR|I just woke up for the day, say good morning.|blob
AFTERNOON_STR|I just came into view. Ask me what I have been up to today|blob
EVENING_STR|I just returned for the night, ask me how my day was.|blob
NIGHT_STR|I am up late, remind me to go to bed!|blob
MOOD_STR|I looked {}, ask about that.|blob
CONVO_STR|Check in time! Ask me how my {} is going. Make your response sound like you are spontaneously asking.|blob
SURVEIL_STR|I am leaving, so be sure to watch the house!|blob
INTRUDER_STR|There is an intruder in the house! Threaten them and order them to leave.|blob
HISTORY_STR|Summarize your history with {}. Focus on facts and things that you learned and don't embellish. Be sure to include key events and topics discussed. Return the answer in a single short paragraph to be used later to refresh your memory about this entire conversation.|blob
